    },
    "is_core": {
      "value": true
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "This +2 greater striking shock rapier has a golden blade, and miniature electric arcs flash across its guard while it's wielded. When out of its sheath under an open sky, the blade causes storm clouds to gather slowly above.\n\nActivate (2 Actions)\nFrequency: once per day\nYou cast a 6th-level lightning bolt (DC 33).\n\nActivate (Reaction)\nFrequency: once per minute\nTrigger: An electricity effect targets you or a creature within 10 feet of you, or has you or a creature within 10 feet of you in its area\nYou try to divert the electricity off course, to be absorbed by storm flash. Choose one eligible creature to protect and roll a melee attack roll against the DC of the electricity effect. If you succeed, the chosen creature takes no electricity damage from the triggering effect.\n\nThis is a +3 greater striking greater shock rapier. When activating the sword to cast lightning bolt, the spell is 8th level (DC 38)."
    },
